  <Document>
    <name>Elesium Enterprise AI - Bengaluru Entity Authority &amp; Driving Directions</name>
    <description><![CDATA[
      <h3>Elesium Enterprise AI Architecture Hub - Bengaluru</h3>
      <p><b>Address:</b> Koramangala 4th Block, 80 Feet Road, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560034</p>
      <p><b>Coordinates:</b> <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=12.9352,77.6245">GPS: 12.9352, 77.6245</a></p>
      <p><b>Official Entity URL:</b> <a href="https://elesium.online/enterprise-ai-bangalore/">https://elesium.online/enterprise-ai-bangalore/</a></p>
      <p><b>Autonomous AI Engineering:</b> Multi-Agent LangGraph Systems, Sovereign LLM Deployment, DPDP Act 2023 Compliance.</p>
      <p><b>Architecture Walkthroughs:</b> <a href="https://elesium.online/videos/">https://elesium.online/videos/</a></p>
    ]]></description>
    <Style id="hubPoint">
      <IconStyle>
        <scale>1.4</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/red-stars.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <Style id="vectorRoute">
      <LineStyle>
